# From "Lift Off" (Wave III - Freedom, CD1-1). F10 despite the wave. Three
# graduated float-up/hold/float-down passes, each a little higher than the
# last, then a full reabsorb -- familiarisation with controlled movement in
# the REBAL before vectors.gws and first-stage-separation.gws ask more of it.
# One line of unrelated crosstalk in the source transcript is dropped.

@segment  lift-off
@title    Lift Off
@levels   F10
@duration ~3m

say With your Resonant Energy Balloon formed around you, safe and floating, you're going to learn to let it move.
pause 6
say Let it float upward. Lighter, and lighter. Slowly and easily.
pause 8
say Hold it right there. Observe from where you're floating — safe, secure, calm.
pause 8
say Now let it descend, slowly, back to where you began.
pause 8
say Let it rise again — a little further this time than before.
pause 8
say Hold it. Observe this new height.
pause 8
say Descend again, slowly, back to where you started.
pause 8
say Once more — let it rise, further than either time before.
pause 8
say Hold, and observe in every direction from here.
pause 8
say Now descend, slowly and calmly, all the way back to where you began.
pause 8
say Let your Resonant Energy Balloon move inward now, and reabsorb into you — because it is you.
pause 10
say Relax, and feel calm and comfortable in Focus 10.
pause 6
